----------------------------------------------\n\n\n\n\n Mission Code Name : Port of Call\n Direction         : North West\n Distance          : 15 miles  \n Difficulty        : 4\n\nSxyth 76470 -2179753 36906 62404\n------------------------------------------------------------------------\n  We have the coordinates of the only fuel facility in this theater.\nGo out there and blow'em up.  Use the portal for return to satisfy your\nsecondary objective.\n------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\n\n\n\n Mission Code Name : Operation Bud Nip\n Direction         : South West\n Distance          : 12 miles  \n Difficulty        : 7\n\nSxyth -1597266 1550440 53079 27556\n------------------------------------------------------------------------\n  The aliens have concluded that they cannot keep operations going on\nthis planet due to our relentless attacks.  In response, a fringe group\nof aliens has decided to take matters into their own hands.  They are\nworking on detonating the whole planet into pieces with an anti-matter\nbomb.\n  Since we have discovered intelligent life under the surface of this\nplanet, this act would eliminate and entire race of friendlies.  In \naddition to the loss of all our forces here, mankind would surely lose\nperhaps our only chance for some allies in this struggle.\n  Land your plane on the strip, and hop down there to take out those\nlunatic aliens before they destroy us all.\n------------------------------------------------------------------------","starts":[{"position_cm":[76470,-2179753,36906],"yaw":62404,"name":"Port of Call"},{"position_cm":[-1597266,1550440,53079],"yaw":27556,"name":"Operation Bud Nip"}]}]},"objects":[{"index":0,"type":0,"name":"Generator orb","position_cm":[443741,-2261488,11200],"angles_u8":[0,0,0],"flags":4281,"model_id":"0","objective":{"object_index":0,"type":0,"name":"Generator orb","position_cm":[443741,-2261488,11200],"quality":2,"flags":4281,"preset_complete":false,"special":